  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Research Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To establish which interventions are most effective in tackling the causes of conflict and the best responses to conflict situations. This research will produce strong policy relevant evidence on how different interventions affect violent conflict including how the contextual factors influence the effectiveness of the interventions, and to trace the changes in the political economy of conflict to examine the evolving incentives faced by those involved.</narrative>
  </description>
